          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("We are free! My lord Kalenz, from this day forward I and my kin are your sworn followers. And there is that which you should know about the treasure the orcs seek..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("I accept your service gratefully, for I will need every sword and bow and spell with which to defeat these invaders. There will be time for talk later; now, we must fight."),
